{"ref":"BDB, אִמֵּר","hw":"אִמֵּר","html":"† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אִמֵּר</span></big>  <strong>n.pr.m. </strong><br><strong>1.</strong>  a priest assigned to Dvd’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 24:14\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.24.14\">1 Ch 24:14</a> perhaps =<br><strong>2.</strong>  ancestor of priest <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 9:12\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.9.12\">1 Ch 9:12</a> cf. <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 11:13\" href=\"/Nehemiah.11.13\">Ne 11:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:37\" href=\"/Ezra.2.37\">Ezr 2:37</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ezra 10:20\" href=\"/Ezra.10.20\">10:20</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:39\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.39\">Ne 7:40</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  priest in Jerem.’s time <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.1\">Je 20:1</a>.<br><strong>4.</strong>  father of Zadok <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 3:29\" href=\"/Nehemiah.3.29\">Ne 3:29</a>.<br><strong>5.</strong>  <strong> n.pr.loc.</strong> (?) <a data-ref=\"Ezra 2:59\" href=\"/Ezra.2.59\">Ezr 2:59</a> = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 7:60\" href=\"/Nehemiah.7.60\">Ne 7:61</a>.","next":"BDB, אֱמֹרִי","prev":"BDB, אָמִיר"}